(ACME GADGETS - SHIPPING AND DELIVERY \(SAMPLE DATA\)) '
() '
(Delivery times) '
(Standard delivery takes 3 to 5 business days. Express delivery takes 1 to 2 business days) '
(and is available for orders placed before 2 pm. Remote areas can add up to 3 extra days.) '
() '
(Tracking your order) '
(A tracking number is emailed when the parcel leaves the warehouse. Tracking can take up to) '
(24 hours to show its first update.) '
ET
