(Missing or delayed parcels) '
(If a parcel has not arrived 7 business days after dispatch, contact support with the order) '
(number. We open an investigation with the courier and either resend the order or refund) '
(it.) '
() '
(Changing the delivery address) '
(The address can be changed only before the order is dispatched. After dispatch, ask the) '
(courier to redirect the parcel using the tracking number.) '
ET
